<p>Column menu (<code>GridMenus.column</code>), right click on a column number - the row of numbers under the
header filters - or Shift+F10 on one with the focus. Select \u203A, then the copies, flat: a Copy \u203A around
them would only add a step. The columns are copied as the row menu copies rows - tab separated text
and an html table, a header line of the labels with <code>copyHeaders</code> - the names as one line of text, a
tab between them. The column numbers have no selection mode: Select \u203A is always shown:</p>
